and so very distressed if someone had suggested abortion with me because this is a baby that already feels like part of me and I've already, you know, looked at what size blueberry they are in the apps. And I already felt like a mother. And we can't assume that because a mother to be is young, that she's not also having those same psychological changes. And really, really hard, Haley. I'm so sorry that you experienced that.

