we'd take our shampoo and our conditioner and our body puff and our razors. And we would poolside have our only shower that week. And we called it our spa. But our kids would be sat on the floor and would be fully showering and together side by side, like with people swimming up and down the electric. But we cannot have been the only moms in the country to be doing that. But what I've learned is showers and being clean and having clean hair. help me feel more put together and help me manage everything.

